      "task_id": "28ac1825-7b23-44ff-892f-3c7463fb330d",
      "text": "We can keep the medical stores here, or send them upriver with the next boat. Neither place has enough.",
      "voice": "Sandra",
      "credits": 3,
      "bytes": 112474,
